  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s21/191c198b> ;
  triage:notes "ATM-QA-005 is a SUBSUMPTION/DUPLICATE of the canonical AG18-QA-006 record. The same stale symbol execute_outbound_send appears in the Deliverables section of sprint-AG21.md (line 77). AG18-QA-006 already comprehensively documents this defect across all sprint docs (AG18.md line 269, AG19.md line 103, AG20.md line 269, AG21.md line 77) and is already dispatched in in-flight AG21-FIX-1 work (arch-ctm mid-fix). The dispatch for AG21-FIX-1 includes updating this exact location to the actual implemented symbol execute_outbound_send_with_runtime_and_post_send_emitter. Do not dispatch separate work for ATM-QA-005; it will be resolved as part of the existing AG18-QA-006 fix dispatch. dispatchReady=false because no independent action is needed." .

